  "job_B1.5.12_20251001_193243": {
    "chunk_text": "haten Simon, se gela\u00feode \u00feone h\u00e6lend to his gereorde, & he swa \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r on \u00fe\u00e6re byrig Hierusalem sum synful wif swi\u00felice forscyldgod on forligere, & heo \u00fea & brohte \u00feyder hyre sealfbox mid deorwyr\u00fere sealfe, & stod \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes fotum bewepende hyre \u00dea geseah se sundorhalga \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00fee hine gela\u00feode & cw\u00e6\u00fe on his ge\u00feance \u00feus, Gif \u00fees lareow witiga Se h\u00e6lend \u00fea andwyrde his ge\u00feance \u00feus cwe\u00f0ende, Simon ic h\u00e6bbe \u00fee sum \u00feing to secgenne. And he cw\u00e6\u00f0, la leof lareow, sege. Se h\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 him to, Twegen gafolgylderas w\u00e6ron feoh scyldige sumum massere, se an him Hw\u00e6t \u00feinc\u00f0 \u00fee nu, Simon, hw\u00e6\u00feer heora lufode hine swi\u00feor. \u00dea andwyrde Simon & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic wene \u00fe\u00e6t se hine lufode swi\u00f0or, \u00feam \u00fee he mare forgeaf. Him andwyrde se h\u00e6lend & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Rihtlice \u00feu demdest. He beseah \u00fea to \u00feam wife & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Simone, Simon, gesyhst \u00feu \u00feis wif? Ic com into \u00feinum huse, & \u00feu ne bude me fur\u00feon to minum fotum w\u00e6ter, & \u00feis wif a\u00fewoh mine fet \u00deu noldest me cyssan. & \u00feis wif sy\u00fe\u00fean heo in com, ne geswac mine fet to cyssanne. \u00deu ne smyredest min heafod mid ele, & heo smyrede mine fet mid deorwur\u00f0re sealfe. For\u00fei ic secge \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6",
